<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῠκ-αίνω</span></b> , fut.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῠκ-ᾰνῶ</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			LXX
			<u>Si.</u>
			12.16
		</span></i>: aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγλύκᾱνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					8.70
				</span></i>
			:—<i>sweeten</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				27.23
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πικραίνω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
			</span></i> l.c.; <i>affect with a sensation of sweetness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀκοήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>produce an effect of sweetness</i>, in Music,
				<i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				p.23
			</span></i> M.:—more freq. in 
				Pass.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκανθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					49.1
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγλυκάνθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					3.17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				3.110
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεγλύκασμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					9.384d
				</span></i>
			, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ-εγλ</span>.
				Diph.Siph.ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.55f
			</span></i>:—<i>to be sweetened, turn sweet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				244b23
			</span></i>; <i>to be affected with a sensation of sweetness</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.121
			</span></i>.</div>
